    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This carefully maintained investment property is divided in 4 spacious self-contained apartments ( 1 x 2 beds & 3 x 1 bed). Situated in this most central location, adjacent  to Stoneybatter, TU Campus at Grangegorman and the Phoenix Park as well as a great variety of nearby shops, restaurants and coffee shops. An ideal choice for those seeking an easily managed investment and where rental accommodation remains in high demand, this property is capable of producing a significant income. Vacant possession will be available to the new purchaser. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \t\t\t\t\t\twith coved and corniced ceiling, under stairs storage and door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nGround floor -1 Bedroom Apartment \r\nKitchen/living Area                                       3. 92m x 3. 83m            fitted kitchen, tiled splash back, spacious living room.\r\n\r\nBathroom                                                          2. 67m x 1. 35m           tiled floor to ceiling, Shower, whb and wc.\r\n\r\nBedroom                                                           3. 73m x 2. 70m            double bedroom, built in wardrobes and wooden flooring.\r\n\r\nGround Floor return - 1 Bedroom Apartment \r\nKitchen/ living area                                      5. 69m x 3. 85m           fitted kitchen, tiled splash back and a spacious light filled living room.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite                                                            1. 35m x 2. 74m           fully Tiled, Shower, whb and wc.\r\n\r\nBedroom                                                           3. 83m x 2. 33m         double bedroom with built-in storage and wood flooring.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor   -  1 Bedroom apartment           \r\nLiving/kitchen Area                                      5. 76m x 3. 84m         fitted kitchen with tiled splashback and a spacious living/dining area.\r\n\r\nBedroom                                                         2. 4m x 3. 84m             double bedroom, wood flooring and built in storage.\r\n\r\nEn-suite                                                          2. 72m x 1. 31m            fully tiled floor to ceiling, with hot press storage, shower, whb and wc.\r\n       \r\nSecond Floor - 2 Bedroom apartment \r\nKitchen/ living area                                   3. 74m x 3. 93m                  fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back, spacious light filled living room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1                                                     3. 81m x 2. 48m                 double bedroom, wood flooring and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom                                                        2. 46m x 1. 33m                 fully tiled floor to ceiling, shower, whb and wc.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2                                                      2. 66m x 2. 97m                 double bedroom, wood flooring and built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nThe property is nicely set back form the street behind wrought iron railings finished with an easily maintained gravel interspersed with some mature planting. The sunny rear garden extends approx. 17 meters from the house and is fully walled set out in lawn with pedestrian access onto a laneway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Sought after residential location adjacent Phoenix Park \r\nAdjacent to village amenities \r\nSubstantial rental potential\r\nIdeal for conversion to family home ( Subject to p.p.)\r\nWalking distance to TU campus at Grangegorman."
      },
